<title>SWEDEN: Sweden finmin says Nordbanken stake still for sale.</title>
<headline>Sweden finmin says Nordbanken stake still for sale.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Monday the state's decision to sell its 59 percent stake in Nordbanken was still valid despite failed merger talks between Nordbanken and S-E-Banken.</p>
<p>Asbrink said in a statement that a merger between the two high street banks would have created a powerful bank.</p>
</text>
